PRIVACY POLICY

Effective Date: November 3, 2026

This Privacy Policy explains how Gen bot for me ("Bot") collects, uses, stores, and protects information when users interact with it on Discord.

1. Information We Collect

The Bot may process the following information when users interact with it:

Discord User IDs

Discord Server IDs

Usernames and display names

Commands and interactions sent to the Bot

Server settings and preferences (if applicable)

2. How We Use Information

Information may be used to:

Provide the Bot's features and commands.

Respond to user interactions.

Maintain and improve the Bot.

Prevent abuse and troubleshoot technical problems.

3. Data Storage

Information is stored only when necessary for the Bot's functionality. Any stored information is handled according to the Bot Owner's data-retention practices.

4. Sharing of Information

We do not sell users' personal information. Information is not shared with third parties except where necessary to operate the Bot or comply with applicable laws.

5. Data Security

We take reasonable measures to protect information against unauthorized access, disclosure, or misuse.

6. Data Retention and Deletion

Information is retained only for as long as necessary for the purposes described in this policy. Users may contact the Bot Owner to request deletion of applicable stored information.

7. Third-Party Services

The Bot operates through Discord. Users are also subject to Discord's own Privacy Policy and Terms of Service.

8. Changes to This Policy

The Bot Owner may update this Privacy Policy when necessary. Updated versions will be published at this URL.

9. Contact Information

For questions or concerns regarding this Privacy Policy, users may contact the Bot Owner through the Bot's support server.

By using the Bot, users acknowledge this Privacy Policy.
